#: ../../source/docs/internal-pressure-failsafe.rst:5
#: 520f1e4980874f31ab62e6219eda15cf
msgid "Internal Pressure Failsafe"
msgstr "内部气压失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-pressure-failsafe.rst:6
#: b27b240ef2db4e2fbde9f099c196ca4c
msgid ""
"Sub can use the barometer normally included with an autopilot to determine "
"if the pressure inside the vehicle has increased too much. This could occur "
"if the enclosure is bowing in and near implosion, or if something is "
"burning/off-gassing, or if there's a big enough leak that water is forcing "
"its way in. It can also be from the internal electronics heat."
msgstr ""
"水下机器人可使用飞控通常内置的气压计来判断飞行器内部气压是否升高过多。这可能发生在外壳向内弯曲接近内爆、内部有燃烧/排气现象、进水量足够大导致水被迫进入，或内部电子元件过热等情况下。"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-pressure-failsafe.rst:8
#: 19fa01faaef64bcea9d9a7a881f40ccd
msgid ""
"The amount of the pressure in pascals is set by "
":ref:`FS_PRESS_MAX<FS_PRESS_MAX>`. If it is exceeded, then the following "
"actions is taken as set by the value of the "
":ref:`FS_PRESS_ENABLE<FS_PRESS_ENABLE>` parameter:"
msgstr ""
"压力阈值（以帕斯卡为单位）由 :ref:`FS_PRESS_MAX<FS_PRESS_MAX>` 设定。若超出该值，则根据 "
":ref:`FS_PRESS_ENABLE<FS_PRESS_ENABLE>` 参数的值采取以下动作："

#: ../../source/docs/internal-pressure-failsafe.rst:10
#: 6f3c3d47f10b48f2897c5f5405ae8a78
msgid "**Disabled** (Value 0) will disable the failsafe entirely."
msgstr "**禁用** （值 0）将完全禁用失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-pressure-failsafe.rst:11
#: cfa69f9bda7140bdbab96782f5ca62c7
msgid "**Warn Only** (Value 1) will send a GCS warning message."
msgstr "**仅警告** （值 1）将向地面站发送警告消息。"
